---
title: Agent Teams Pattern (Shared Task List)
---
flowchart TB
    Lead["Main Agent (Team Lead)"]

    Lead -->|"Spawn Team & Assign Tasks"| TaskList

    subgraph TaskList ["Shared Task List"]
        direction TB
        T1["☐ Task 1"]
        T2["☐ Task 2"]
        T3["☐ Task 3"]
        T4["☐ Task 4"]
    end

    subgraph Team [" "]
        direction LR
        MA[Teammate A]
        MB[Teammate B]
        MC[Teammate C]
        MA <-->|Communicate| MB
        MB <-->|Communicate| MC
    end

    TaskList -->|Claim| MA
    TaskList -->|Claim| MB
    TaskList -->|Claim| MC

    MA -->|Work| RA([Result A])
    MB -->|Work| RB([Result B])
    MC -->|Work| RC([Result C])

